  m_Rarety: 0
  m_Description: "Once a devoted naturalist in life, this spirit now roams as an
    eternal collector in the afterlife. \nHe gathers the creatures, spirits, and
    souls of the world into his Eternal Menagerie, a mystical cavern as deep and
    dark as his mind can pitcure it, where he endlessly studies evolution itself.
    \nIn death, his curiosity has only deepened, and he continues his tireless quest
    to understand the shifting nature of all living things."
